              "text": "Already seeing clearly. Two pairs is the limit. Three and I'd see the future."
            }
          ],
          "else": [
            {
              "op": "setFlag",
              "flag": "memelab_clear_vision",
              "value": true
            },
            {
              "op": "playSound",
              "key": "item_use"
            },
            {
              "op": "say",
              "text": "I put the reversed 3D glasses on over my own. Red on the right. The room is red-blue on the wrong side too..."
            },
            {
              "op": "playSound",
              "key": "discovery"
            },
            {
              "op": "say",
              "text": "...and the two cancel out. Two wrong glasses make a right. First time in my life."
            },
            {
              "op": "say",
              "text": "Wait... is that... a Pepe? A rare Pepe, just sitting there on the desk! I couldn't see it before through the distortion!"
            }
          ]
        }
